Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:52.56,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）1/8 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:52.56,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}亚历山德罗娃 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}7-6(3) 4-6 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 萨巴伦卡 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:01.78,EN,,0,0,0,,There were a lot of twists
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:01.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一路起起伏伏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:03.30,EN,,0,0,0,,and turns along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.78,0:00:03.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,波折不断
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:05.30,EN,,0,0,0,,What ultimately turned in your favor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:05.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,最终是什么帮你翻了盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:06.82,EN,,0,0,0,,to close it out there in the third set?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你拿下第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:08.34,EN,,0,0,0,,What was the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,关键的不同在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, honestly, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I just tried to play every single point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是尽量把每一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.70,EN,,0,0,0,,as it was the last one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,都当成最后一分打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:17.46,EN,,0,0,0,,because with her like you you didn't get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为对她 你不会有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:20.34,EN,,0,0,0,,a lot of uh chances during the matches
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多机会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:23.22,EN,,0,0,0,,but I had a lot today but I couldn't realize all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:23.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我拿到不少 但没能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.90,EN,,0,0,0,,of them but honestly I was like I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,全部把握住 但说实话 我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:27.86,EN,,0,0,0,,was trying not to think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:27.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽量不去想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:29.38,EN,,0,0,0,,about you know about the score
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,关于比分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.22,EN,,0,0,0,,about like anything just you know hit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都不想 就是打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.30,EN,,0,0,0,,the ball and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,仅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.98,EN,,0,0,0,,But I'm super happy that I could win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别开心能赢下这场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,because after I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为打完
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.02,EN,,0,0,0,,after second set I thought I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:38.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘打完的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.26,EN,,0,0,0,,so it's already passed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:40.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我以为机会已经溜走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Well you this was your 10th career meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你们生涯第十次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,with Aryna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,和萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:45.06,EN,,0,0,0,,You're familiar. You're now dead even five
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很了解她了 现在战绩追平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:45.94,EN,,0,0,0,,wins each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:45.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,五比五
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.46,EN,,0,0,0,,How much did that steal your confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,这给了你多少信心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:48.58,EN,,0,0,0,,to know that you could kind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.46,0:00:48.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你觉得能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.90,EN,,0,0,0,,of get her off her rhythm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,打乱她的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I mean, I don't know if I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 我说不好是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.30,EN,,0,0,0,,could get her the rhythm because I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,真打乱了她的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.62,EN,,0,0,0,,she played great and um I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她打得很好 我也说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.98,EN,,0,0,0,,maybe I was, you know, some lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能有几个球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:01.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and some shots and honestly, I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,我运气不错吧 说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.46,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm super happy with that result
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:03.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我对这个结果特别满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.74,EN,,0,0,0,,because beating number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为赢下世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:06.82,EN,,0,0,0,,it's, you know, it always feels nice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉总是很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:09.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and um I will just enjoy tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:09.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚我就好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:12.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,没错 你应该好好享受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.14,EN,,0,0,0,,And Ekaterina,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,叶卡捷琳娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:16.18,EN,,0,0,0,,this is your first 1,000-level quarterfinal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是你首次打进千分级八强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.90,EN,,0,0,0,,since February of 2025.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,自2025年2月以来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.10,EN,,0,0,0,,What has that journey been like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一路你是怎么熬过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.70,EN,,0,0,0,,in the in between for you and what makes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场胜利对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.62,EN,,0,0,0,,that so special this win?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,为什么这么特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:25.14,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean it it means a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我意义重大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.46,EN,,0,0,0,,because after you know um a lot of struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.14,0:01:27.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为经历了很多挣扎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:30.42,EN,,0,0,0,,on the court I'm just uh super happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:30.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,在场上 我现在特别高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:32.42,EN,,0,0,0,,that I you know can enjoy tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,能重新享受网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.18,EN,,0,0,0,,I can enjoy my time on the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,能享受在场上的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:36.34,EN,,0,0,0,,because there is some difficult moments
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.18,0:01:36.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为之前有过一些艰难时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and there's no happiness on the court
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,那时候在场上完全没有开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:41.30,EN,,0,0,0,,with for me but now I feel great
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:41.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,可言 但现在我感觉很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:42.26,EN,,0,0,0,,and thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:42.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:44.26,EN,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere was amazing tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:44.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚的氛围太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:45.78,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm just enjoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是在享受这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:47.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, you're in newfound territory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.78,0:01:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打进了从没到过的领域
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:48.10,EN,,0,0,0,,into the quarterfinals here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:48.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,八强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:49.22,EN,,0,0,0,,at the National Bank Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,国家银行公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:50.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Ekaterina.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:50.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝你好运 叶卡捷琳娜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
